        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We relevel single-wides and double-wides across Lady Lake, shimming and adjusting piers until floors sit flat and doors swing right. Most jobs finish in a day.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(22,51,44,0.05);">
