        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">With The Villages turnover driving constant sales in Lady Lake, we provide leveling with written documentation for buyers, sellers, lenders, and insurance carriers, and we keep a 24/7 line open for pre-closing crunches.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4DCC8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(22,51,44,0.05);">
